Vertical edge count: upper bound, exact singleton or inclusive range.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"f42df01e-e096-4b5f-ac8b-b5a453f297a7"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
