Max[n,m] through n m; every vertex has a transverse neighbour\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"4ccdb562-8e01-4008-967e-ee3f735c2b65"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "48046af0-0e48-4b75-9a43-bb0d0253ca0d"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<AtMostOneEdgeLift\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
